_You overhear Wren losing an argument with language, and Maewyn declining to help._

Wren: Ashvale. Ashvale. Nothing rhymes with Ashvale.

Maewyn: Good.

Wren: That was not a request for approval. That was a cry for help.

Maewyn: Hm.

